data: {"id": "1fed62ca9ed44bb8-thinking-layer-220", "run_id": "1fed62ca9ed44bb8", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。该状态通常由镜像拉取失败、配置错误（ConfigMap/Secret 缺失）或卷挂载失败引起。为了区分这些原因，我需要根据 Runbook 获取更多信息。\n\n根据 `ContainerCreating` 状态，最可能的几个 Runbook 是 `pod-imagepull-failed.md`、`pod-config-error.md` 和 `pod-volume-mount-failed.md`。由于我无法直接查看事件，我将先获取 `pod-imagepull-failed.md` 和 `pod-config-error.md` 作为初步诊断依据，因为它们是 `ContainerCreating` 阶段最常见的阻塞原因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789048805490}

