data: {"id": "1fed62ca9ed44bb8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1752", "run_id": "1fed62ca9ed44bb8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据采集到的真实工具结果，对 `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 的调查事实如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与当前异常确认\n- **身份**: Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`，UID `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`。\n- **当前状态**: **Pending / ContainerCreating**。\n- **阻塞阶段**: 卷挂载阶段 (Volume Mounting)。\n\n### 2. 根因证据（支持 `VolumeMountFailed` 场景）\n- **核心事件**: `kubectl_describe` 显示大量 `Warning FailedMount` 事件。\n- **错误原文**: `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n- **配置验证**: `kubectl_get_yaml` 确认 Pod Spec", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048867834, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

